  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c6509451f7eb74c",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴正式发布 trl 与 peft 的集成，让任何人都能更容易地用强化学习微调大语言模型（LLM）！本文将解释为什么这是对现有微调方法颇具竞争力的替代方案。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e764a6732d44cfe",
      "translationZh": "注意：peft 是一个可应用于许多机器学习用例的通用工具，但它对 RLHF 尤其有价值——因为这种方法特别吃内存！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99ede865f9b6a70a",
      "translationZh": "如果你想直接深入代码，请看 TRL 文档页面上的示例脚本。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "简介",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fb8981bb7b0a3d5f",
      "translationZh": "LLM 与 RLHF",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bbc759ea2f6fc1b",
      "translationZh": "LLM 结合 RLHF（基于人类反馈的强化学习）似乎正在成为构建 ChatGPT 这类强大 AI 系统的下一个标配方案。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd972dbeaefa3b11",
      "translationZh": "用 RLHF 训练语言模型通常包括以下三步：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9abece2f40dc2fec",
      "translationZh": "1- 在特定领域或指令与人类示范语料上微调预训练 LLM",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e881293976e1f59",
      "translationZh": "2- 收集人工标注数据集并训练奖励模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf7fbfcbc3fdd9d7",
      "translationZh": "3- 用奖励模型和该数据集，以 RL（如 PPO）继续微调第 1 步的 LLM",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75d3b36cb645223c",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT 训练流程概览：从数据收集到 RL 部分。来源：OpenAI 的 ChatGPT 博文",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "871526829ceff2fd",
      "translationZh": "基础 LLM 的选择相当关键。撰写本文时，许多任务可以“开箱即用”的“最好”开源 LLM 是指令微调过的 LLM。知名模型有：BLOOMZ、Flan-T5、Flan-UL2 和 OPT-IML。这些模型的缺点是尺寸：要得到一个像样的模型，你至少得玩 100 亿参数以上的规模——全精度光把模型装进单卡就需要最多 40GB GPU 显存，还完全没开始训练！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fe09df5d243f23ae",
      "translationZh": "什么是 TRL？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "092c77b975fce50e",
      "translationZh": "trl 库的目标是让 RL 这一步更简单、更灵活，让任何人都能在自己的数据集和训练设置上用 RL 微调语言模型。在众多应用中，你可以用这个算法微调模型生成正面影评、做受控生成，或让模型毒性更低。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ac4b9a227bcd52f",
      "translationZh": "用 trl，你可以以分布式或在单设备上运行最流行的深度 RL 算法之一 PPO！我们借助 Hugging Face 生态的 accelerate 使之成为可能，任何用户都能把实验扩展到可观的规模。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83e78f124261e4c7",
      "translationZh": "用 RL 微调语言模型大致遵循下面详述的流程。这需要原始模型的 2 份副本；为避免活动模型偏离其原始行为/分布太远，你需要在每个优化步计算参考模型的 logits。这给优化过程加上了一个硬约束：每个 GPU 设备上始终至少要有两份模型。模型越大，把整套设置塞进单卡就越棘手。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "468f1791320172d9",
      "translationZh": "TRL 中 PPO 训练设置概览。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b83ddd2c767aa72f",
      "translationZh": "在 trl 中你还可以让参考模型与活动模型共享层，避免完整副本。该功能的一个具体示例见去毒化示例。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "15dd8d48d02fddb3",
      "translationZh": "大规模训练",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10ca4c198ea7230a",
      "translationZh": "大规模训练充满挑战。第一个挑战是把模型及其优化器状态装进可用的 GPU 设备。单个参数占用的 GPU 显存取决于它的“精度”（更具体说是 dtype）。最常见的 dtype 是 float32（32 位）、float16 和 bfloat16（16 位）。最近，一些“新奇”精度（如 int8，8 位）在满足一定条件和约束下已开箱支持训练和推理。简言之，把模型加载到 GPU 设备上：每 10 亿参数全精度要 4GB，半精度 2GB，int8 只要 1GB。想深入了解这个话题，请看这篇深入探讨的博文：https://huggingface.co/blog/hf-bitsandbytes-integration。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eed2dbb29ba141cb",
      "translationZh": "如果你使用 AdamW 优化器，每个参数需要 8 字节（例如模型有 10 亿参数，完整的 AdamW 优化器就需要 8GB GPU 显存——来源）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7896705f2d7ef921",
      "translationZh": "应对大规模挑战已有许多技术。最熟悉的范式是流水线并行、张量并行和数据并行。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6d93caf9b4b86f3",
      "translationZh": "图片来源：这篇博文",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d19462e881f2f908",
      "translationZh": "数据并行下，同一个模型并行托管在多台机器上，每个实例喂不同的数据批次。这是最直接的并行策略，本质上是复制单 GPU 情形，trl 已支持。流水线并行和张量并行则把模型本身分布到多台机器：流水线并行按层切分模型，而张量并行把张量运算（如矩阵乘法）切分到多 GPU。这些模型并行策略需要把模型权重分片到许多设备上，这要求你定义激活与梯度跨进程的通信协议。实现起来并不简单，可能需要采用 Megatron-DeepSpeed 或 Nemo 等框架。同样值得强调的是其他对扩展 LLM 训练至关重要的工具，如自适应激活检查点和融合内核。并行范式的延伸阅读见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb0b42c350c33605",
      "translationZh": "于是我们问了自己一个问题：仅靠数据并行能走多远？能不能用现有工具把超大型训练过程（包括活动模型、参考模型和优化器状态）装进单个设备？答案看起来是肯定的。主要原料是：适配器（adapter）与 8 位矩阵乘法！下面几节来介绍这些主题：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "94ba41102a0f9536",
      "translationZh": "8 位矩阵乘法",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a950e380622ea6b3",
      "translationZh": "高效 8 位矩阵乘法最早由论文 LLM.int8() 提出，旨在解决量化大型模型时的性能退化问题。该方法把 Linear 层底层执行的矩阵乘法拆成两个阶段：离群隐状态部分用 float16 执行，“非离群”部分用 int8 执行。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a950e380622ea6b3",
      "translationZh": "高效 8 位矩阵乘法最早由论文 LLM.int8() 提出，旨在解决量化大型模型时的性能退化问题。该方法把 Linear 层底层执行的矩阵乘法拆成两个阶段：离群隐状态部分用 float16 执行，“非离群”部分用 int8 执行。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "577eada703204ca5",
      "translationZh": "简言之，如果使用 8 位矩阵乘法，全精度模型的体积可以缩小到 1/4（半精度模型则为 1/2）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "232bebc31ea5050b",
      "translationZh": "低秩适应与 PEFT",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13fb75893ca27793",
      "translationZh": "2021 年，一篇名为《LoRA: Low-Rank Adaption of Large Language Models》的论文证明：冻结预训练权重、为注意力层的 query 和 value 矩阵创建低秩版本，就能完成大语言模型的微调。这些低秩矩阵的参数远少于原模型，使微调所需 GPU 显存大幅下降。作者证明低秩适配器的微调可以达到与全模型微调相当的结果。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5542f80d6fcff0a",
      "translationZh": "原始（冻结）预训练权重的输出激活（左）由权重矩阵 A 和 B 组成的低秩适配器（右）增广。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9033a766e3b732e1",
      "translationZh": "这项技术让 LLM 微调只需原内存需求的一小部分。不过也有一些缺点：由于适配器层额外的矩阵乘法，前向与反向传播大约慢一倍。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "51628ec4a1a7a341",
      "translationZh": "什么是 PEFT？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0af06d9c87ac80b",
      "translationZh": "参数高效微调（PEFT）是 Hugging Face 的库，为在 LLM 上创建和微调适配器层提供支持。peft 与 🤗 Accelerate 无缝集成，可借助 DeepSpeed 和 Big Model Inference 处理大模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af7335d8d479774f",
      "translationZh": "该库支持许多最先进的模型，并附有丰富的示例，包括：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a4c9b1f2949a3262",
      "translationZh": "因果语言建模",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff16f3fba4a4ecf1",
      "translationZh": "条件生成",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d6626a2ec9da353a",
      "translationZh": "图像分类",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e42e0c7ef9bdfc72",
      "translationZh": "int8 8 位训练",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc60cc47ec2925f9",
      "translationZh": "Dreambooth 模型的低秩适应",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74c91519c88b04c0",
      "translationZh": "语义分割",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b78a85b0188d8ac4",
      "translationZh": "序列分类",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05803bfbb7dd1b50",
      "translationZh": "token 分类",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e22e92bafb9a947b",
      "translationZh": "该库仍在密集而活跃地开发中，未来几个月将公布许多新特性。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e1f10ffc21af7464",
      "translationZh": "用低秩适配器微调 200 亿参数模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6e6aa2592a541d3",
      "translationZh": "前提知识讲完了，现在让我们一步一步过完整条流水线，并用图解释如何在单张 24GB GPU 上用上述工具以 RL 微调一个 200 亿参数的 LLM！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "404254d5e24f4200",
      "translationZh": "第 1 步：以 8 位精度加载活动模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ab017471705e6c9",
      "translationZh": "以 8 位精度加载模型可比全精度模型节省最多 4 倍内存",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1583d31428f5a3ee",
      "translationZh": "使用 transformers 给 LLM“免费”减内存的办法，是按 LLM.int8 描述的方法以 8 位精度加载模型。只需在调用 from_pretrained 时加上 load_in_8bit=True 标志（更多信息见这里）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0dfb62f3f1977cba",
      "translationZh": "如上一节所述，估算加载模型所需 GPU 显存的一个“窍门”是按“每 10 亿参数”思考。1 字节=8 位，全精度模型（32 位=4 字节）每 10 亿参数需 4GB，半精度 2GB，int8 模型 1GB。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d069815af2f046c",
      "translationZh": "那么第一步，先把活动模型按 8 位加载。看看第二步要做什么！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "29f0c342dbe159df",
      "translationZh": "第 2 步：用 peft 添加额外的可训练适配器",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d5b80ecd0d439b2",
      "translationZh": "你可以轻松在冻结的 8 位模型上加适配器，通过只训练一小部分参数来降低优化器状态的内存需求",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e73c0466ac02d54",
      "translationZh": "第二步是在模型里加入适配器并让它们可训练。这能急剧减少活动模型所需的可训练权重。这一步借助 peft 库，几行代码即可完成。注意：适配器训练好后，可以轻松推送到 Hub 供以后使用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "260f317a26510a0e",
      "translationZh": "第 3 步：用同一个模型获取参考与活动的 logits",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cb9f3502a26407c",
      "translationZh": "你可以用 peft API 轻松停用和启用适配器。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97404f8a13dd254f",
      "translationZh": "由于适配器可以停用，我们可以用同一个模型获取 PPO 所需的参考与活动 logits，而不必创建同一模型的两份副本！这利用了 peft 库的 disable_adapters 上下文管理器特性。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "362169c22bd7d25d",
      "translationZh": "训练脚本概览：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0870046afd01166",
      "translationZh": "下面我们描述如何用 transformers、peft 和 trl 训练一个 200 亿参数的 gpt-neox 模型。这个示例的最终目标，是在内存受限的环境里微调 LLM 生成正面影评。类似步骤也适用于其他任务，比如对话模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cab65e156b3773e6",
      "translationZh": "总体上有三个关键步骤和训练脚本：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4fef649aacd01f7b",
      "translationZh": "脚本——在冻结的 8 位模型上为 imdb 数据集的文本生成微调低秩适配器。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a1e2dad62475b1e4",
      "translationZh": "脚本——把适配器层合并进基础模型权重并存储到 hub。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1287770d14be564f",
      "translationZh": "脚本——对低秩适配器做情感微调以生成正面评论。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dba8b8d1fc5517b9",
      "translationZh": "我们在 24GB 的 NVIDIA 4090 GPU 上测试了这些步骤。虽然可以在 24GB GPU 上完成整个训练，但完整的训练运行是在 🤗 研究集群的单张 A100 上进行的。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cca16a47de6ce837",
      "translationZh": "训练过程的第一步是在预训练模型上微调。通常这需要多张高端 80GB A100 GPU，所以我们选择训练低秩适配器。我们把它当作因果语言建模设定，用 imdb 数据集（包含影评及其正面/负面情感标签）的样本训练了一个 epoch。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48b406f6d2213e88",
      "translationZh": "gpt-neox-20b 模型在 imdb 数据集上训练一个 epoch 期间的训练损失",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c41cfc871bd8950d",
      "translationZh": "为了把适配后的模型拿来做进一步的 RL 微调，我们首先需要合并适配后的权重：以 16 位浮点加载预训练模型与适配器，把权重矩阵相加（应用适当的缩放）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db9f59d223e75536",
      "translationZh": "最后，我们在冻结的 imdb 微调模型之上再微调另一个低秩适配器。我们用一个 imdb 情感分类器为 RL 算法提供奖励。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e6e1fd56f6e9b06",
      "translationZh": "对 peft 适配的 200 亿参数模型做 RL 微调以生成正面影评时的奖励均值。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a02296ada0036f65",
      "translationZh": "这个实验的完整 Weights and Biases 报告见这里，如果你想看更多图表和文本生成样例。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9844294f17b36ec2",
      "translationZh": "我们在 trl 中实现了一个新功能，让用户借助 peft 和 bitsandbytes 库，以合理的成本用 RLHF 微调大语言模型。我们证明了在 24GB 消费级 GPU 上微调 gpt-neo-x（bfloat16 下 40GB！）是可能的，并期待社区广泛使用这一集成来微调更大的模型、分享出色的成果。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d96cd9062da08313",
      "translationZh": "我们还为这一集成的下一步找到了一些有趣的方向",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de20f5b415e91ec8",
      "translationZh": "它在多 GPU 设定下如何扩展？我们主要会探索这个集成随 GPU 数量的扩展性：能否开箱即用地应用数据并行，还是需要相关库引入新特性。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e2ce88e2ed7addf1",
      "translationZh": "可以用什么工具提高训练速度？我们观察到这个集成的主要缺点是整体训练速度。未来我们希望探索让训练快得多的可能方向。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69824d3b0e70ca6a",
      "translationZh": "参考文献",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fcdd2cd5a6265efa",
      "translationZh": "并行范式：https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/v4.17.0/en/parallelism",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3bb741cb10f3798",
      "translationZh": "transformers 中的 8 位集成：https://huggingface.co/blog/hf-bitsandbytes-integration",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
